To answer the question: Clean draft within a month, end of summer as a worst-case scenario.

The private repo with the code base is planned to be released at the same time as the draft. There are two private repos: one has an R package which implements GMO for Stan programs (there are additional decision decisions before we can get it into Stan natively), and another package which has it available in Python using Edward (https://github.com/blei-lab/edward).

Dustin

