Subject: Re: [stan-users] Can STAN handle probabilistic inclusion of data in subsets used for parameter estimation?
Message-ID: <D00ZJ2AmPKs.uhX3Ej14AAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <D00ZJ2AmPKs.LvdBfiNBAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <D00ZJ2AmPKs.Cyn8pyEVAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <D00ZJ2AmPKs.LvdBfiNBAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
