Subject: Re: [stan-users] will anti-correlated features yield anti-correlated beta-weights?
Message-ID: <hfhrg6rimPE.sfQ4Jrq4AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <hfhrg6rimPE.SnN-VKx_AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <hfhrg6rimPE.Kp7JjvRxCwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <hfhrg6rimPE.SnN-VKx_AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
