Subject: mixed effect model: ADVI and Maximum Likelihood results are very different
Message-ID: <rPplYQiIq-A.4vswbsISBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/rPplYQiIq-A/m/4vswbsISBAAJ>
