Consider what? You have a 507 by 6 data.frame, which if you execute the maximum likelihood covariance on the transpose, it will have 501 eigenvalues that are zero, while positive definiteness requires that they all be positive. You have to change the covariance estimator in order to get an estimated covariance matrix that is positive definite.

