Subject: Re: Perform Joint Approximate Diagonalization (JAD) on a set of matrices
Message-ID: <1-kJN4pu3vg.xIMnEp2oAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <1-kJN4pu3vg._ddorThRQgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
