I was suggested by stan that I need to increase acceptance rate to be above 0.999 and given the maximum treedepth is 16, does it mean that I need to run again with treedepth set to be greater than 16?

Each chain took about 5000-6000 seconds to run which is incredibly long and I am wondering whether there is something wrong with my model construction that causes the above problems. I am looking forward to hearing any constructive feedback, thanks!

