Subject: Rejecting initial value: Gradient evaluated at the initial value is not finite.
Message-ID: <9ktPxbAU7Kg.JuY47o5mBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/9ktPxbAU7Kg/m/JuY47o5mBgAJ>
