Subject: Bayesian principal component analysis in STAN and JAGS using LOO as comparison
Message-ID: <5R2-QUDiyME.lrhEeLuQBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/5R2-QUDiyME/m/lrhEeLuQBgAJ>
