Ok, so the problem is that there is zero variance in the tail, i.e. all the values in the tail are the same. To see this you can do this in R:

    log_lik <- read.delim("doesnt_work.txt", header=FALSE)[, 2]
    log_weights <- -1 * log_lik
    x <- log_weights - max(log_weights)
    cutoff <- quantile(x, 0.8)  # find where the tail (20% largest values) starts
    print(x[x > cutoff])

